{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Opt Out of Targeted Marketing.\\\"}],\\\"If you wish to limit or opt out of third-party advertising, you can do one or more of the following:\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"class\\\":\\\"underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Change your Browser Settings\\\"}],\\\". The Options/Settings section of most internet browsers will tell you how to manage cookies and other technologies that may be uploaded to your device, including how to disable such technologies. You can disable our cookies, or all cookies, through your browser settings, but please note, disabling cookies may impact some of the features of our Site and prevent them from operating as intended. You can learn more about cookies, including how to see what cookies have been uploaded to your device and how to manage and delete them, by visiting\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.allaboutcookies.org\\\",\\\"raw_url\\\":\\\"https://www.allaboutcookies.org\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"All About Cookies\\\"}],\\\".\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"class\\\":\\\"underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Change your Preferences\\\"}],\\\". To change your preferences with respect to certain online ads and to obtain more information about ad networks and online behavioral advertising visit the\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://optout.networkadvertising.org/?c=1\\\",\\\"raw_url\\\":\\\"https://optout.networkadvertising.org/?c=1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"National Advertising Initiative Consumer Opt Out page\\\"}],\\\"and the\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://optout.aboutads.info/?c=2\\u0026lang=EN\\\",\\\"raw_url\\\":\\\"https://optout.aboutads.info/?c=2\\u0026lang=EN\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Digital Advertising Alliance's Consumer Choice Tool\\\"}],\\\". Please note that even if you opt out of receiving interest-based advertising, you will still receive advertisements, but they will be more general in nature. In addition, the electronic device you use to visit our Site may offer relevant privacy settings; please see the device settings for details.\\\"]}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Opt Out of Marketing Communications.\\\"}],\\\"You can opt out of marketing or advertising emails by clicking on the unsubscribe button in the email. To opt-out of other marketing communications, please contact us as set forth in the \\\\\\\"Contact Us\\\\\\\" section below.\\\"]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"26:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"7. COOKIES AND OTHER TRACKING TECHNOLOGIES\\\"}]]}]\\n27:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"We use cookies and other tracking technologies including pixel tags and web beacons to gather more information about how the Site is used and for advertising purposes.\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"28:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"About Cookies.\\\"}],\\\"A \\\\\\\"cookie\\\\\\\" is a small text file that our Site saves onto your computer or device when you use the Site that allows the Site to remember your actions and preferences and recognize you or your browser. Web beacons / pixel tags are small graphics on a webpage that monitor your activity when viewing a webpage. Generally, the type of information we collect through cookies and other tracking technologies is specific to your computer or other device and includes the IP address, date and time the device accessed our Site, what parts of our Site were visited, your internet services provider, the device ID number, approximate geographic location, browser type, the websites you visit before and after coming to our Site, and whether the web pages requested were delivered successfully.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Why we use Cookies.\\\"}],\\\"We use these tools to learn whether the Site is operating optimally, learn whether you are a repeat visitor to our Site, personalize advertising, obtain valuable data and statistics about the usage and effectiveness of our Site, and help us provide an enjoyable, personalized and innovative online experience for you. We may combine information gathered from cookies with other Personal Information.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Session Replay Tools.\\\"}],\\\"We may also use session replay tools. Session replay is the reproduction of a user's interactions on a website or web application exactly how the user actually experienced it. Session replay transforms logged user events, such as mouse movements, clicks, page visits, scrolling, tapping, etc., into a reproduction of what the user actually did on the site or app. We use session replay tools to gain a more complete picture of how users interact with our Site.\\\"]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"8. ANALYTICS\\\"}]]}]\\n2a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Our Site uses third-party cookies and analytics tools, including those listed below.\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Google Analytics.\\\"}],\\\"Google Analytics is a web analytics service provided by Google, Inc. ( \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Google\\\\\\\"\\\"}],\\\"), to assist us in understanding how our Site is used. Google Analytics will place cookies on your computer or mobile device that will generate information that we select about your use of the Site, including your computer's or mobile device's IP address. That information will be transmitted directly to and stored by Google. You may refuse the use of cookies by selecting the appropriate settings on your browser. The use of cookies by Google Analytics is covered by Google's privacy policy, available at\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\\\",\\\"raw_url\\\":\\\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\"}],\\\". Google allows you to opt out of Google Analytics on their\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout\\\",\\\"raw_url\\\":\\\"https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"opt-out page\\\"}],\\\".\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Google Tag Manager.\\\"}],\\\"We may use Google Tag Manager ( \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"GTM\\\\\\\"\\\"}],\\\"), a tag management system that allows JavaScript and HTML tags to be quickly deployed and updated on portions of our Site for tracking and analytics. We use GTM on our Site to include Google Analytics. If you have opted out of Google Analytics, GTM takes this opt out into account. For more information about Google's privacy practices applicable to GTM, please refer to Google's\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\\\",\\\"raw_url\\\":\\\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\"}],\\\